<title>USA: U.S. interest rates mixed in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. interest rates mixed in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve announced average interest rates for the week ended June 20, compared with the June 13 week, as follows:</p>
<p>   Federal funds rate.................5.42 vs 5.62</p>
<p>   3-month Treasury bills.............4.99 vs 4.91</p>
<p>   3-month commercial paper...........5.63 vs 5.64</p>
<p>   3-month bankers acceptances........5.58 vs 5.58</p>
<p>   3-month CDs........................5.66 vs 5.65</p>
<p>   3-month Eurodollar.................5.63 vs 5.65</p>
<p>   30-year Government bond............6.73 vs 6.69</p>
</text>
